  "details": "The built-in camera in VRChat is less than ideal, because I like all my screenshots of VR moments to be stereoscopic. It's a waste of a good medium if all the screenshots you take are in 2D again.\n\nThe camera could presumably be modified to use two actual cameras, and use this to produce stereoscopic photos, in the same style as the SteamVR screenshot button but with much better resolution.",
